* Base-paper MDFRGC with the A2 degeneration resistor shunted by a triode NMOS (control voltage vc)
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibn vdd vbn dc 20u
Mdn vbn vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=1u L=200n AD=0.2p AS=0.2p PD=2.4u PS=2.4u
Cbn vbn 0 2p
Mb in vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=9.662u L=200n AD=1.932p AS=1.932p PD=19.72u PS=19.72u
M1 out x in 0 nmos90 W=6.669u L=100n AD=1.334p AS=1.334p PD=13.74u PS=13.74u
R1 vdd out 2.4022k
M2 x in 0 0 nmos90 W=15.01u L=100n AD=3.002p AS=3.002p PD=30.42u PS=30.42u
R2 vdd x 578.84
M3 x out s3 0 nmos90 W=9.747u L=100n AD=1.949p AS=1.949p PD=19.89u PS=19.89u
R3 s3 0 1.1335k
C3 s3 0 92.429f
Mr3 s3 vc 0 0 nmos90 W=1.068u L=100n AD=0.2135p AS=0.2135p PD=2.535u PS=2.535u
.param vcv=0.3029
Vc vc 0 dc {vcv}

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.step param vcv 0 1 0.05   ; trimming sweep: bandwidth/peaking vs control voltage
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;.tran 0 6.667e-08 6.667e-09 6.667e-12   ; eye: replace Iin by the PRBS source below
;Ipr 0 in PWL file=prbs7_3G.txt   ; 20 uA pk-pk NRZ PRBS7 (prbs7_*.txt is in this folder)
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
